<title>USA: FSA qualifies six muni issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>FSA qualifies six muni issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Security Assurance said Monday it qualified for bond insurance the following six municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today:</p>
<p>--Eden Prairie, Minn., $7.07 million general obligation school bonds.</p>
<p>--Derry Township School District, Pa., $2.165 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Laredo, Texas, $3.66 million combined purpose, $2.86 million combined purpose and $5.83 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Sheboygan, Wis., $4,195 million GOs.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
